    "title": "Folsom's Old Carl's Jr. Could Become a Coffee Shop - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juan Carlos Montoya ,\n1 days ago Better Buzz Coffee Roasters appears to be eyeing a spot at 1016 E. Bidwell St. in Folsom, based on a general manager job posting the San Diego-based chain has listed on LinkedIn naming that exact address. The site is a former Carl’s Jr. restaurant, roughly 3,078 square feet with a drive-thru, near neighbors like Target, Crunch Fitness and HomeGoods. Read full article",
